>> Animal := Yam-khoom tshiab.
Animal thaum-tuaj: ['sound:'] ua: { :s nws-li sound := s. }.
Animal thaum-tuaj: ['makeSound'] ua: { Tawm sau-ntawv: nws-li sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal tshiab.
Cat thaum-tuaj: ['init'] ua: { nws-li sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat thaum-tuaj: ['meow'] ua: { tus-kheej makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
